        "original_id": "cea467dc-e526-59e2-999e-a1440675aa56",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Bluff, Tom Hanks, Halle Berry, Jim Broadbent\n- Companies: Industrial Light & Magic\n- Roles: special effects supervisor, digital matte artist, visual effects supervisor\n- Films: The Island, Transformers, Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, Star Trek, Avatar, The Avengers, Cloud Atlas, Pacific Rim, The Big Short, Doctor Strange\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Visual Effects, 89th Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Bluff is an English special effects supervisor.\n- Richard Bluff worked at Industrial Light & Magic as a digital matte artist and visual effects supervisor.\n- Richard Bluff is known for visual effects work on The Island, the Transformers films from 2007 to 2011, Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, Star Trek, Avatar, The Avengers, Cloud Atlas, Pacific Rim, The Big Short, and Doctor Strange.\n- Richard Bluff received an Academy Award for Best Visual Effects nomination for Doctor Strange at the 89th Academy Awards.\n- Tom Hanks, Halle Berry, and Jim Broadbent lead the ensemble cast of Cloud Atlas.",
